WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.032 --> 00:00:01.707
- [Voiceover] This is
what it would be like if

00:00:01.707 --> 00:00:04.167
Disney princesses wore realistic makeup.

00:00:05.637 --> 00:00:08.487
Aurora would have some
seriously clumpy mascara

00:00:08.487 --> 00:00:11.227
and raccoon eyes after sleeping that long.

00:00:11.227 --> 00:00:13.482
Note the dried drool as well.

00:00:15.379 --> 00:00:17.551
Had Mulan really tried
to wipe her makeup off

00:00:17.551 --> 00:00:19.536
in two swipes with her sleeve, it wouldn't

00:00:19.536 --> 00:00:21.152
have been that simple.

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:24.780
Even Ariel's waterproof mascara would

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:27.484
have been no match for
a lifetime under water.

00:00:27.484 --> 00:00:29.790
And her hair wouldn't
have been camera ready.

00:00:32.024 --> 00:00:34.624
Belle's magenta lip gloss
would have smeared everywhere

00:00:34.624 --> 00:00:36.656
after making out with the Beast.

00:00:36.656 --> 00:00:39.446
He would have ended up wearing it too.

00:00:41.265 --> 00:00:43.610
Jasmine's liquid eyeliner, after a windy,

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:45.665
tear-inducing magic carpet ride,

00:00:45.665 --> 00:00:46.884
may have moved a bit.

00:00:46.884 --> 00:00:48.370
And again, her hair wouldn't have been

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:50.148
camera-ready.

00:00:50.148 --> 00:00:51.909
And Princess Tiana's makeup definitely

00:00:51.909 --> 00:00:53.833
wouldn't have been this perfect after...

00:00:53.833 --> 00:00:55.993
oh, wait, it's her wedding day.

00:00:55.993 --> 00:00:58.013
Yes, yes, it would have.

00:00:58.013 --> 00:01:00.497
Bridal makeup artist magic.

00:01:00.497 --> 00:01:03.847
(smooth electronic music)

00:01:06.081 --> 00:01:07.933
(whoosh, creak)

